    <bf:note>
      <bf:Note>
	<rdfs:label xml:lang="ru-latn">"Sovershena się kniga, povelěniemʺ velikagō gospodarę t︠s︡arę i velikagō knęzę Alek︠s︡ěę Mikhailovicha vseę Rūsīi samoderzht︠s︡a, vtretʹee lěto bogomʺ khranimyę egō derzhavy, i pri syně egō gosudarevě blagověrnomʺ t︠s︡arevichě i velikomʺ knęzě Dimitrīi Alek︠s︡ěevichi︠e︡, vpervoe lěto, rozhenīę egō lěta, ZRNZ gō, genvarę, v KḞ denʹ"--Colophon.</rdfs:label>
	<rdfs:label xml:lang="ru-cyrl">"Совєршєна сиѧ книга, повєлѣниємъ вєликагѡ господарѧ царѧ и вєликагѡ кнѧзѧ Алєѯѣѧ Михаиловича всєѧ Рꙋсіи самодєржца, втрєтьєє лѣто богомъ хранимꙑѧ єгѡ дєржавꙑ, и при сꙑнѣ єгѡ госѹдарєвѣ благовѣрномъ царєвичѣ и вєликомъ кнѧзѣ Димитріи Алєѯѣєвичѥ, впєрвоє лѣто, рожєніѧ єгѡ лѣта, ЗРНЗ гѡ, гєнварѧ, в КѲ дєнь"--Colophon.</rdfs:label>
      </bf:Note>
    </bf:note>
    <bf:note>
      <bf:Note>
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/mnotetype/refcitation"/>
	<rdfs:label>Zernova, A.S. Knigi kirillovskoi pechati, izdannye v Moskve v XVI-XVII vekakh,</rdfs:label>
	<bflc:citation>216</bflc:citation>
      </bf:Note>
    </bf:note>
    <bf:note>
      <bf:Note>
	<rdfs:label>Muscovite law code (ulozhenie) of 1649 / translated and edited by Richard Hellie. Irvine, Calif. : C. Schlacks, JR., 1988.</rdfs:label>
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/mnotetype/related"/>
      </bf:Note>
    </bf:note>
    <bf:instanceOf rdf:resource="http://id.loc.gov/resources/REPLACE/21550295#Work"/>
    <bf:hasItem>
      <bf:Item rdf:about="http://id.loc.gov/resources/REPLACE/21550295#Item">
	<bf:heldBy rdf:resource="http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/organizations/dlc"/>
	<bf:title>
	  <bf:VariantTitle>
	    <bf:note>
	      <bf:Note>
		<rdfs:label>LC copy bears inscribed title</rdfs:label>
	      </bf:Note>
	    </bf:note>
	    <bf:mainTitle>Ulozhenie velikogo gosudari︠a︡ t︠s︡ari︠a︡ i velikogo kni︠a︡za Aleksei︠a︡ Mikhalovicha [...]</bf:mainTitle>
	    <bf:note>
	      <bf:Note>
		<rdfs:label xml:lang="ru-cyrl">LC copy bears inscribed title</rdfs:label>
	      </bf:Note>
	    </bf:note>
	    <bf:mainTitle xml:lang="ru-cyrl">Уложение великого государя царя и великого княза Алексея Михаиловича [...]</bf:mainTitle>
	  </bf:VariantTitle>
	</bf:title>
	<bf:note>
	  <bf:Note>
	    <rdfs:label>LC copy has repaired leaves 9, 59, 105, 122, 155, 156, 157, 160, 166, 169, 186, 187, 193, 207, 227, 266, 285, 288, 320, 321, 325.</rdfs:label>
	  </bf:Note>
	</bf:note>
	<bf:note>
	  <bf:Note>
	    <rdfs:label>LC copy leaf 61 is wanting. Leaf 63 is not present in volume (see Zernova) but text is continuous (cf. Hellie).</rdfs:label>
	  </bf:Note>
	</bf:note>
	<bf:custodialHistory>LC copy bears inscriptions on rear paste-down leaf and facing endleaf: "Sii︠a︡ kniga gospodina podpolkovnika Ḟedora Seitovicha Khrushchova." Also bears the inscription "Sii︠a︡ kniga [...] Mikhaila Ivanovicha [...]" on the facing endleaf. Other illegible inscriptions appear on endleaves.</bf:custodialHistory>
